@startuml event_history_migration
title Restart-safe Events v2 History Migration
' Contract baseline: pi-mono-java-design 2ee2a3211da68ad87b0d9cab353e691b00bdaebd
' Contract source: chat-events-v2-history-design.md section 2.0
' Java baseline: pi-mono-java 72f3550e
' Implementation commit: 247ee0af
' Source: modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/resources/db/gaussdb/upgrade/V1_to_V2__schema.sql
' Source: modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/resources/db/gaussdb/upgrade/V1_to_V2__data.sql
' Source: modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/resources/db/gaussdb/upgrade/V1_to_V2__verify.sql
' Pi baseline: 5cd93f688aaab89dbb6dfa4aca535f21796ae185
' Pi source: packages/agent/src/agent-loop.ts#runLoop
' Observed behavior: old Java Entries do not prove a complete and safe public projection.
' Design reason: migrate only reviewed or mechanically provable complete Sessions.
' Java divergence: the release migration is a CampusClaw architecture and security change.
start
:Stop all Session writers;
:Wait for accepted executions to reach durable terminal state;
:Set the release search_path to the target Session schema;
:Run schema and reapply runtime privileges;
:Run safe gap verification;

while (Does verification return gaps?) is (yes)
  :Review only from trusted original sources;
  :Stage exact count, stable IDs, order, time, type, and safe payload;
  :Run one data transaction;
  :Lock Session, sequence, Entry, event, marker, and review tables;
  :Validate existing and staged payload, type, count, and same-Session links;
  :Leave every incomplete or unsafe Session unchanged;
  :Select up to 500 complete Sessions in ID order;
  :Insert public events and exact markers;
  :Advance each shared sequence by inserted event count;
  :Delete consumed review input;
  if (Does the SQL transaction succeed?) then (yes)
    :Commit the complete batch;
  else (no)
    :Roll back the complete batch;
  endif
  :Run safe gap verification again;
endwhile (no)

:Deploy the complete v2 application;
:Restore traffic;
stop

note right
Verification outputs only IDs, old type,
and a fixed reason. It never returns payload
or review text.
end note

note left
Schema, data, verification, and rollback
must use the same target search_path.
Do not run data while Session writes continue.
end note
@enduml
